    "updated_at": "2015-08-05T13:06:05Z",
    "body": "This doesn't make sense. The whole point of body.json() is that the parsing can happen entirely in C++ without calling back in to JavaScript. If you want to do the parsing in JavaScript, you should just use `body.text()` and `JSON.parse` it yourself.\n",
